# Exact arithmetic. Every number here is exact unless it is asked to be a
# Num, a floating-point number, as the Float column is.

sheet Sums

Float : Num

Case            | Exact                 | Float                   | Same
Tenths          | = 0.1 + 0.2           | =1e-1 + 2e-1            | *
Take away       | = 1 - 0.9             | =1 - 9e-1               | *
Squared         | = 1.1 * 1.1           | = 1.1e0 * 1.1e0         | *
Big numbers     | = 2**64 + 1 - 2**64   | = 2e0**64 + 1 - 2e0**64 | *
Ten years at 5% | = 1000 * (1 + 5%)**10 | = 1e3 * (1 + 5e-2)**10  | *

Same := Exact == Float

sheet Split

# A bill split three ways stays exact: the shares add back to the bill.

Person | Share
Ana    | *
Ben    | *
Cy     | *

Share := 100 / 3

sheet Check

Item             | Value
Bill             | 100
Shares added up  | = Split.Share.sum()
Nothing lost     | = Split.Share.sum() == 100
